 "answer": "The most recent server logs are in the `Ollama` folder under `%LOCALAPPDATA%`, in a file named `server.log`. The docs say:\n\n\"`explorer %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Ollama` contains logs, and downloaded updates\" [ollama/docs/windows.md]\n\n\"_server.log_ contains the most recent server logs\" [ollama/docs/windows.md]\n\nSo the file is `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Ollama\\server.log`. You can open the folder by pressing `Win+R`, entering `explorer %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Ollama`, and then opening `server.log`. `%LOCALAPPDATA%` usually expands to `C:\\Users\\<your-username>\\AppData\\Local`, though I haven't confirmed that for your machine.",
